
### 1. CREATE BOOKING
POST http://localhost:3000/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "student_id": 2,
    "carrel_id": 2,
    "booking_date": "2026-11-15"
}

###

### 2. GET ALL BOOKINGS
GET http://localhost:3000/bookings

###

### 3. GET BOOKING BY ID
GET http://localhost:3000/bookings/2

###

### 4. UPDATE BOOKING
PUT http://localhost:3000/bookings/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "student_id": 1,
    "carrel_id": 2,
    "booking_date": "2026-11-16"
}

###

### 5. TEST INVALID STUDENT ID
POST http://localhost:3000/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "student_id": 999,
    "carrel_id": 1,
    "booking_date": "2026-11-17"
}

###

### 6. DELETE BOOKING
DELETE http://localhost:3000/bookings/2

